container fn_test_opsigC_neg1
{
	// NEGATIVE (definition-time, op-sig batch C): THE classic aggregation error —
	// declaring a partitioned sum's result over the DATA domain instead of the
	// partition set. The derived K5 signature binds the result domain to the
	// partitioning argument's VALUES unit (Region), so the declared House domain
	// conflicts at the definition's first reference. At reduction the same config
